// test_chart_render.ae — the node tree (Chartist's scene/node.spec and
// scene/tree.spec, ported where they do not test immutability), the hooks
// that replace Chartist's event pipeline, the theme that replaces its
// stylesheet, and the vg drawing: a chart drawn into a deferred vg scene on
// the recording backend, read back shape by shape. Negative controls close
// each area.
//
// The specs here are ported from Chartist v2.0.0 (github.com/chartist-js/chartist, commit
// cf181279cf60a9c89cc0b19bb05e82b48f9ebcdf), maintained in Aether from here on.
